	(text "J15/J18 are parallel output-bus sources. Use ONE source per continuous harness.\nIDC pin1 to wire1 at all taps; selected logic5V and raw actuator5V stay separate.\nTwo-output baseline. Larger populations need current/capacitance review." (at 139.7 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e1e181b3-729a-58dc-9609-b8404e31ca01"))
